==Restrictions==
Cat Deploy Cost: Only 900¢ or less

==Battleground==
*1 [[Primeval Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*6 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 3~5 seconds<sup>90f~150f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Rel]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]]'s [[Talents]] and [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] are still viable options to use in this stage in the same way as its predecessor; you can also use [[Healer (Special Cat)|Healer Cat]] to freeze Primeval Cyclone, although a proper setup is needed. [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Professor Cat Jobs]] is also useful here as in the original debut level, but is highly RNG-dependent and requires luring.

It is possible to stall the Primeval Cyclone using [[Charybdis' Mouth (Merciless)|the previous stage]]'s drop [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Modern Cat]], although note that you still need supporting [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|Crowd-Controllers]] and Research [[Cat Combo|Combos]].

